#
# uv alone, the resolver of the lock gate (packaging/lock-deps.sh --gate). It has a lock of its
# own so that it can be installed and run while the other locks are still unproven: the gate
# first proves with the standard library that packaging/requirements-uv.lock pins uv and
# nothing else, with hashes PyPI publishes and older than 7 days, installs it into a venv of
# its own and runs it by absolute path. uv has no dependencies.
uv
